  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-mode=\"public\" data-zone=\"briefs\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>Entity Profile: Mark Carney — Canopticon</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Entity Profile: Mark Carney — a CANOPTICON Brief. 5 verified claims, every quote verbatim-checked against external sources.\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400;1,6..72,500&display=swap\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=peynad\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"top-strip\">\n<div class=\"ts-left\">\n  <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)\"></span>\n  <span>live · kept current</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ts-right\"><a class=\"op-link\" href=\"/op\">operator console →</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub-nav\">\n<a href=\"/\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center\">\n  <div class=\"wordmark\">canopticon<span class=\"dot\">.</span><span class=\"wordmark-sub\">forensic intelligence</span></div>\n</a>\n<div class=\"pub-nav-links\"><a href=\"/investigations\" class=\"\">Investigations</a><a href=\"/topics\" class=\"\">Topics</a><a href=\"/library\" class=\"\">Library</a><a href=\"/about\" class=\"\">About</a></div>\n<a href=\"/search\" class=\"pub-nav-search\">\n  <span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">Search the record</span>\n  <kbd>/</kbd>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"app-shell\" style=\"display:block\">\n<div><div class=\"container\">\n\n<article class=\"container reading\" style=\"max-width:760px\">\n  <div class=\"kicker\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">Reference · Entity profile</div>\n  <h1>Entity Profile: Mark Carney</h1>\n  <div class=\"coord\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Updated 2026-06-10</div>\n  <div class=\"coord\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Verified: 5 claims · 2 dropped on verbatim-check · independent judge: @cf/qwen/qwq-32b</div>\n  \n  <div class=\"prose\" style=\"margin-top:28px\"><p>Mark Carney is an entity involved in controversy, with multiple connections to other entities, including Pierre Poilievre and Justin Trudeau. According to various sources, Carney's ethics disclosure has been described as a 'loophole-filled, unethical smokescreen'.</p></div>\n  <section class=\"srclog\" style=\"margin-top:40px\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:-.01em;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:16px\">Sources — 3</h2>\n  <div class=\"srclog-row\">\n  <div class=\"srclog-main\">\n    <span class=\"srclog-title\">Carney was present for just 28 of the 96 QP sessions since the 2025 general election</span>\n    <span class=\"srclog-meta\">\"present for just 28 of the 96 QP sessions since the 2025 general election\" — <a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-facec16e-8872-4a9f-a905-feabce4b8aa9-text-markdown\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Library source</a></span>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"srclog-kind\">01</span>\n</div><div class=\"srclog-row\">\n  <div class=\"srclog-main\">\n    <span class=\"srclog-title\"><span class=\"chip\" title=\"An attributed assertion — contested material, not neutral fact\">asserted by Mark Carney</span> Mark Carney: Carney largely neutralized Poilievre&#39;s attack when he signed a prime ministerial directive</span>\n    <span class=\"srclog-meta\">\"Carney largely neutralized Poilievre&#39;s attack when he signed a prime ministerial directive\" — <a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-facec16e-8872-4a9f-a905-feabce4b8aa9-text-markdown\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Library source</a></span>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"srclog-kind\">02</span>\n</div><div class=\"srclog-row\">\n  <div class=\"srclog-main\">\n    <span class=\"srclog-title\"><span class=\"chip\" title=\"An attributed assertion — contested material, not neutral fact\">asserted by Pierre Poilievre</span> Pierre Poilievre: You promised you would deliver the fastest-growing economy in the G7. You delivered the only recession in the G7… The recession is real.</span>\n    <span class=\"srclog-meta\">\"You promised you would deliver the fastest-growing economy in the G7. You delivered the only recession in the G7… The recession is real.\" — <a href=\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-facec16e-8872-4a9f-a905-feabce4b8aa9-text-markdown\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Library source</a></span>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"srclog-kind\">03</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n  <div class=\"piece-note\" style=\"margin-top:36px\">\n    <span class=\"dr-h\">How this Brief was built</span>\n    <p>Every claim on this page is anchored to a verbatim quote from a stored source document in the public Library, verified mechanically (the drafting model can only reference stored quotes — it cannot fabricate evidence). A different model independently judged whether each quote supports its claim. Attributed assertions are always shown with who asserts them. The trust boundary is mechanical, not editorial.</p>\n  </div>\n</article>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"Entity Profile: Mark Carney\",\"headline\":\"Entity Profile: Mark Carney\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-10T23:30:39.758Z\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-10T23:30:39.758Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"CANOPTICON\"},\"citation\":[{\"@type\":\"CreativeWork\",\"url\":\"/library/compass-artifact-wf-facec16e-8872-4a9f-a905-feabce4b8aa9-te